  "privacy": {
    "link": "Privacy",
    "title": "Privacy",
    "body": "EventSplit uses no cookies, no tracking and no ads.\n\nWhat we store: only what you enter in the event — participant names, and optionally an email or phone, allergies and dietary notes, plus shopping items and expenses. No accounts, no payments.\n\nWhere: data is stored on Supabase servers in Europe.\n\nHow long: an event is kept until the host deletes it — there is no automatic deletion, because the group revisits it as a lasting record.\n\nDeletion: the host can erase the event and all its data at any time from the event settings with “Delete event”. You can also write to endika2@gmail.com.\n\nContact: endika2@gmail.com."
  },
